# Build context hygiene for docker/next.Dockerfile, whose context is the bench
# root (the workspace lockfile and harness/shim.js both belong in the image).
#
# The fixtures are excluded on purpose: they are ~13 MB of derived JSONL and
# they are MOUNTED read-only into the measured container by docker/compose.yaml
# rather than baked in, so both stacks' containers read the same bytes from the
# same path and "both servers read the same bytes" (§2.5) is a property of the
# topology instead of two Dockerfiles agreeing.

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
data
analyze
fixtures/*/ticks.jsonl
docker/tls
.git
*.log
